{"text":"<p>https://youtu.be/AMm4joD2u3w</p><p><br /></p><p>Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa</p><p><br /></p><p># Abhidhammapiṭake </p><p><br /></p><p>## Dhammasaṅgaṇīpāḷi ^1-0</p><p><br /></p><p>### Mātikā ^1-0-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### Tikamātikā ^1-0a-0</p><p><span><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8.892208\">00:08</span> 1. (Ka) kusalā dhammā.</span></p><p>(Kha) akusalā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) abyākatā dhammā. ^1-0a-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"15.41919879019165\">00:15</span> 2. (Ka) sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttā dhammā. ^1-0a-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"30.29979689128113\">00:30</span> 3. (Ka) vipākā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) vipākadhammadhammā.</p><p>(Ga) nevavipākanavipākadhammadhammā. ^1-0a-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"39.92348295422363\">00:39</span> 4. (Ka) upādiṇṇupādāniyā [upādinnupādāniyā (syā.)] dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) anupādiṇṇupādāniyā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) anupādiṇṇaanupādāniyā [anupādinnānupādāniyā (syā.)] dhammā. ^1-0a-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"51.18749785504151\">00:51</span> 5. (Ka) saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) asaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) asaṃkiliṭṭhaasaṃkilesikā [asaṃkiliṭṭhāsaṃkilesikā (syā.)] dhammā. ^1-0a-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"63.36376506866455\">01:03</span> 6. (Ka) savitakkasavicārā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) avitakkavicāramattā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) avitakkaavicārā [avitakkāvicārā (syā.)] dhammā. ^1-0a-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"73.76396983024597\">01:13</span> 7. (Ka) pītisahagatā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) sukhasahagatā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) upekkhāsahagatā dhammā. ^1-0a-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"82.85992715640259\">01:22</span> 8. (Ka) dassanena pahātabbā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) bhāvanāya pahātabbā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) neva dassanena na bhāvanāya pahātabbā dhammā. ^1-0a-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"95.77197415640259\">01:35</span> 9. (Ka) dassanena pahātabbahetukā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) bhāvanāya pahātabbahetukā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) neva dassanena na bhāvanāya pahātabbahetukā dhammā. ^1-0a-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"111.48575902098084\">01:51</span> 10. (Ka) ācayagāmino dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) apacayagāmino dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) nevācayagāmināpacayagāmino [nevācayagāmino nāpacayagāmino (syā.)] dhammā. ^1-0a-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"122.05357595422363\">02:02</span> 11. (Ka) sekkhā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) asekkhā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) nevasekkhanāsekkhā [nevasekkhānāsekkhā (sī. syā.)] dhammā. ^1-0a-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"130.0055659923706\">02:10</span> 12. (Ka) parittā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) mahaggatā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) appamāṇā dhammā. ^1-0a-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"137.6388449408722\">02:17</span> 13. (Ka) parittārammaṇā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) mahaggatārammaṇā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) appamāṇārammaṇā dhammā. ^1-0a-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"146.47128197329712\">02:26</span> 14. (Ka) hīnā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) majjhimā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) paṇītā dhammā. ^1-0a-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"152.67087109346008\">02:32</span> 15. (Ka) micchattaniyatā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) sammattaniyatā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) aniyatā dhammā. ^1-0a-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"160.85545410871887\">02:40</span> 16. (Ka) maggārammaṇā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) maggahetukā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) maggādhipatino dhammā. ^1-0a-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"169.61490003623962\">02:49</span> 17. (Ka) uppannā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) anuppannā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) uppādino dhammā. ^1-0a-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"176.95135194468688\">02:56</span> 18. (Ka) atītā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) anāgatā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) paccuppannā dhammā. ^1-0a-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"184.35859517738342\">03:04</span> 19. (Ka) atītārammaṇā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) anāgatārammaṇā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) paccuppannārammaṇā dhammā. ^1-0a-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"193.1584168664856\">03:13</span> 20. (Ka) ajjhattā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) bahiddhā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) ajjhattabahiddhā dhammā. ^1-0a-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"201.07762311062623\">03:21</span> 21. (Ka) ajjhattārammaṇā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) bahiddhārammaṇā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) ajjhattabahiddhārammaṇā dhammā. ^1-0a-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"211.2784670629425\">03:31</span> 22. (Ka) sanidassanasappaṭighā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) anidassanasappaṭighā dhammā.</p><p>(Ga) anidassanaappaṭighā [anidassanāppaṭighā (syā.)] dhammā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"222.76182404196166\">03:42</span> Tikamātikā. ^1-0a-22</p><p><br /></p><p>#### Dukamātikā ^1-0b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Hetugocchakaṃ ^1-0b-1-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"225.40911805340576\">03:45</span> 1. (Ka) hetū dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) na hetū dhammā. ^1-0b-1</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"230.35255695994567\">03:50</span> 2. (Ka) sahetukā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) ahetukā dhammā. ^1-0b-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"234.47281889700318\">03:54</span> 3. (Ka) hetusampayuttā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) hetuvippayuttā dhammā. ^1-0b-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"241.08094015258789\">04:01</span> 4. (Ka) hetū ceva dhammā sahetukā ca.</p><p>(Kha) sahetukā ceva dhammā na ca hetū. ^1-0b-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"250.00956988555907\">04:10</span> 5. (Ka) hetū ceva dhammā hetusampayuttā ca.</p><p>(Kha) hetusampayuttā ceva dhammā na ca hetū. ^1-0b-5</p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"260.1236821411438\">04:20</span> 6. (Ka) na hetū kho pana dhammā sahetukāpi.</span></p><p>(Kha) ahetukāpi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"267.31962378256225\">04:27</span> Hetugocchakaṃ. ^1-0b-6</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Cūḷantaradukaṃ ^1-0b-2-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"270.5247888626709\">04:30</span> 7. (Ka) sappaccayā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) appaccayā dhammā. ^1-0b-7</p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> <span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"275.9339959523163\">04:35</span> </span><span>8. (Ka) saṅkhatā dhammā.</span></p><p>(Kha) asaṅkhatā dhammā. ^1-0b-8</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"280.5896568588562\">04:40</span> 9. (Ka) sanidassanā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) anidassanā dhammā. ^1-0b-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"285.3418280953674\">04:45</span> 10. (Ka) sappaṭighā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) appaṭighā dhammā. ^1-0b-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"290.120271043869\">04:50</span> 11. (Ka) rūpino dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) arūpino dhammā. ^1-0b-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"294.88669313542175\">04:54</span> 12. (Ka) lokiyā dhammā .</p><p>(Kha) lokuttarā dhammā. ^1-0b-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"299.22325694659423\">04:59</span> 13. (Ka) kenaci viññeyyā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) kenaci na viññeyyā dhammā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"306.51206997520444\">05:06</span> Cūḷantaradukaṃ. ^1-0b-13</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Āsavagocchakaṃ ^1-0b-3-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"310.1520799847412\">05:10</span> 14. (Ka) āsavā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) no āsavā dhammā. ^1-0b-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"315.32740505531314\">05:15</span> 15. (Ka) sāsavā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) anāsavā dhammā. ^1-0b-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"319.56928591989134\">05:19</span> 16. (Ka) āsavasampayuttā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) āsavavippayuttā dhammā. ^1-0b-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"326.0954710858307\">05:26</span> 17. (Ka) āsavā ceva dhammā sāsavā ca.</p><p>(Kha) sāsavā ceva dhammā no ca āsavā. ^1-0b-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"335.87309296185305\">05:35</span> 18. (Ka) āsavā ceva dhammā āsavasampayuttā ca.</p><p>(Kha) āsavasampayuttā ceva dhammā no ca āsavā. ^1-0b-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"347.4008628817444\">05:47</span> 19. (Ka) āsavavippayuttā kho pana dhammā sāsavāpi.</p><p>(Kha) anāsavāpi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"355.16426001335145\">05:55</span> Āsavagocchakaṃ. ^1-0b-19</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Saṃyojanagocchakaṃ ^1-0b-4-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"358.9444209408722\">05:58</span> 20. (Ka) saṃyojanā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) no saṃyojanā dhammā. ^1-0b-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"364.0398520591278\">06:04</span> 21. (Ka) saṃyojaniyā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) asaṃyojaniyā dhammā. ^1-0b-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"369.8251258130798\">06:09</span> 22. (Ka) saṃyojanasampayuttā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) saṃyojanavippayuttā dhammā. ^1-0b-22</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"377.1851641163483\">06:17</span> 23. (Ka) saṃyojanā ceva dhammā saṃyojaniyā ca.</p><p>(Kha) saṃyojaniyā ceva dhammā no ca saṃyojanā. ^1-0b-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"388.3204649160767\">06:28</span> 24. (Ka) saṃyojanā ceva dhammā saṃyojanasampayuttā ca.</p><p>(Kha) saṃyojanasampayuttā ceva dhammā no ca saṃyojanā. ^1-0b-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"401.64887510299684\">06:41</span> 25. (Ka) saṃyojanavippayuttā kho pana dhammā saṃyojaniyāpi.</p><p>(Kha) asaṃyojaniyāpi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"411.11229400953675\">06:51</span> Saṃyojanagocchakaṃ. ^1-0b-25</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Ganthagocchakaṃ ^1-0b-5-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"415.08001312207034\">06:55</span> 26. (Ka) ganthā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) no ganthā dhammā. ^1-0b-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"419.60814990463257\">06:59</span> 27. (Ka) ganthaniyā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) aganthaniyā dhammā. ^1-0b-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"425.18450601525876\">07:05</span> 28. (Ka) ganthasampayuttā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) ganthavippayuttā dhammā. ^1-0b-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"432.22410497138975\">07:12</span> 29. (Ka) ganthā ceva dhammā ganthaniyā ca.</p><p>(Kha) ganthaniyā ceva dhammā no ca ganthā. ^1-0b-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"442.3609548779297\">07:22</span> 30. (Ka) ganthā ceva dhammā ganthasampayuttā ca.</p><p>(Kha) ganthasampayuttā ceva dhammā no ca ganthā. ^1-0b-30</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"454.46601496757506\">07:34</span> 31. (Ka) ganthavippayuttā kho pana dhammā ganthaniyāpi.</p><p>(Kha) aganthaniyāpi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"463.5010759885559\">07:43</span> Ganthagocchakaṃ. ^1-0b-31</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Oghagocchakaṃ ^1-0b-6-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"467.02409903242494\">07:47</span> 32. (Ka) oghā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) no oghā dhammā. ^1-0b-32</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"471.33523504577636\">07:51</span> 33. (Ka) oghaniyā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) anoghaniyā dhammā. ^1-0b-33</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"476.79106487983705\">07:56</span> 34. (Ka) oghasampayuttā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) oghavippayuttā dhammā. ^1-0b-34</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"483.687628125885\">08:03</span> 35. (Ka) oghā ceva dhammā oghaniyā ca.</p><p>(Kha) oghaniyā ceva dhammā no ca oghā. ^1-0b-35</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"493.4315040247955\">08:13</span> 36. (Ka) oghā ceva dhammā oghasampayuttā ca.</p><p>(Kha) oghasampayuttā ceva dhammā no ca oghā. ^1-0b-36</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"504.9051610972748\">08:24</span> 37. (Ka) oghavippayuttā kho pana dhammā oghaniyāpi.</p><p>(Kha) anoghaniyāpi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"514.408784961853\">08:34</span> Oghagocchakaṃ. ^1-0b-37</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Yogagocchakaṃ ^1-0b-7-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"517.2650700534058\">08:37</span> 38. (Ka) yogā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) no yogā dhammā. ^1-0b-38</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"522.8636840419616\">08:42</span> 39. (Ka) yoganiyā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) ayoganiyā dhammā. ^1-0b-39</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"527.4246299828338\">08:47</span> 40. (Ka) yogasampayuttā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) yogavippayuttā dhammā. ^1-0b-40</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"534.4252541144409\">08:54</span> 41. (Ka) yogā ceva dhammā yoganiyā ca.</p><p>(Kha) yoganiyā ceva dhammā no ca yogā. ^1-0b-41</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"545.0239499847412\">09:05</span> 42. (Ka) yogā ceva dhammā yogasampayuttā ca.</p><p>(Kha) yogasampayuttā ceva dhammā no ca yogā. ^1-0b-42</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"556.7127258798371\">09:16</span> 43. (Ka) yogavippayuttā kho pana dhammā yoganiyāpi.</p><p>(Kha) ayoganiyāpi.</p><p><br /></p><p> <span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"566.3233157730255\">09:26</span> Yogagocchakaṃ. ^1-0b-43</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Nīvaraṇagocchakaṃ ^1-0b-8-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"569.4878989198913\">09:29</span> 44. (Ka) nīvaraṇā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) no nīvaraṇā dhammā. ^1-0b-44</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"574.5842609027252\">09:34</span> 45. (Ka) nīvaraṇiyā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) anīvaraṇiyā dhammā. ^1-0b-45</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"580.472007874115\">09:40</span> 46. (Ka) nīvaraṇasampayuttā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) nīvaraṇavippayuttā dhammā. ^1-0b-46</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"587.8321871678467\">09:47</span> 47. (Ka) nīvaraṇā ceva dhammā nīvaraṇiyā ca.</p><p>(Kha) nīvaraṇiyā ceva dhammā no ca nīvaraṇā. ^1-0b-47</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"598.4873919198914\">09:58</span> 48. (Ka) nīvaraṇā ceva dhammā nīvaraṇasampayuttā ca.</p><p>(Kha) nīvaraṇasampayuttā ceva dhammā no ca nīvaraṇā. ^1-0b-48</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"610.1919628989106\">10:10</span> 49. (Ka) nīvaraṇavippayuttā kho pana dhammā nīvaraṇiyāpi.</p><p>(Kha) anīvaraṇiyāpi .</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"619.1509570038147\">10:19</span> Nīvaraṇagocchakaṃ. ^1-0b-49</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Parāmāsagocchakaṃ ^1-0b-9-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"622.7522150247955\">10:22</span> 50. (Ka) parāmāsā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) no parāmāsā dhammā. ^1-0b-50</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"629.1761518397827\">10:29</span> 51. (Ka) parāmaṭṭhā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) aparāmaṭṭhā dhammā. ^1-0b-51</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"633.8481869465942\">10:33</span> 52. (Ka) parāmāsasampayuttā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) parāmāsavippayuttā dhammā. ^1-0b-52</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"641.255684786377\">10:41</span> 53. (Ka) parāmāsā ceva dhammā parāmaṭṭhā ca.</p><p>(Kha) parāmaṭṭhā ceva dhammā no ca parāmāsā. ^1-0b-53</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"652.2888358989105\">10:52</span> 54. (Ka) parāmāsavippayuttā kho pana dhammā parāmaṭṭhāpi.</p><p>(Kha) aparāmaṭṭhāpi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"661.3940079656677\">11:01</span> Parāmāsagocchakaṃ. ^1-0b-54</p><p><br /></p><p>##### Mahantaradukaṃ ^1-0b-10-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"665.3441799408722\">11:05</span> 55. (Ka) sārammaṇā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) anārammaṇā dhammā. ^1-0b-55</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"670.7274270705719\">11:10</span> 56. (Ka) cittā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) no cittā dhammā. ^1-0b-56</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"675.3598870686645\">11:15</span> 57. (Ka) cetasikā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) acetasikā dhammā. ^1-0b-57</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"680.1282868607635\">11:20</span> 58. (Ka) cittasampayuttā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) cittavippayuttā dhammā. ^1-0b-58</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"686.2722448435974\">11:26</span> 59. (Ka) cittasaṃsaṭṭhā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) cittavisaṃsaṭṭhā dhammā. ^1-0b-59</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"692.8474288664856\">11:32</span> 60. (Ka) cittasamuṭṭhānā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) no cittasamuṭṭhānā dhammā. ^1-0b-60</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"700.0867610667572\">11:40</span> 61. (Ka) cittasahabhuno dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) no cittasahabhuno dhammā. ^1-0b-61</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"706.0481608664855\">11:46</span> 62. (Ka) cittānuparivattino dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) no cittānuparivattino dhammā. ^1-0b-62</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"713.6173308950958\">11:53</span> 63. (Ka) cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) no cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānā dhammā. ^1-0b-63</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"723.4639499866486\">