 class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"968.7112550438691\">16:08</span> 95. (Ka) arūpāvacarā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) na arūpāvacarā dhammā. ^1-0b-95</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"974.2545000209808\">16:14</span> 96. (Ka) pariyāpannā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) apariyāpannā dhammā. ^1-0b-96</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"980.2789179084473\">16:20</span> 97. (Ka) niyyānikā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) aniyyānikā dhammā. ^1-0b-97</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"985.7266061964569\">16:25</span> 98. (Ka) niyatā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) aniyatā dhammā. ^1-0b-98</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"990.5827360953674\">16:30</span> 99. (Ka) sauttarā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) anuttarā dhammā. ^1-0b-99</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"995.1042349084472\">16:35</span> 100. (Ka) saraṇā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) araṇā dhammā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"999.4505331487732\">16:39</span> Piṭṭhidukaṃ.</p><p><span>Abhidhammadukamātikā. ^1-0b-100</span></p><p><br /></p><p>##### Suttantikadukamātikā ^1-0b-14-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1006.1350330686646\">16:46</span> 101. (Ka) vijjābhāgino dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) avijjābhāgino dhammā. ^1-0b-101</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1011.8596640686645\">16:51</span> 102. (Ka) vijjūpamā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) vajirūpamā dhammā. ^1-0b-102</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1016.8513049809266\">16:56</span> 103. (Ka) bālā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) paṇḍitā dhammā. ^1-0b-103</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1020.8358069713897\">17:00</span> 104. (Ka) kaṇhā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) sukkā dhammā. ^1-0b-104</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1024.7158268378753\">17:04</span> 105. (Ka) tapanīyā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) atapanīyā dhammā. ^1-0b-105</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1029.763567125885\">17:09</span> 106. (Ka) adhivacanā dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) adhivacanapathā dhammā. ^1-0b-106</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1034.7069641907349\">17:14</span> 107. (Ka) nirutti dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) niruttipathā dhammā. ^1-0b-107</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1039.908944005722\">17:19</span> 108. (Ka) paññatti dhammā.</p><p>(Kha) paññattipathā dhammā. ^1-0b-108</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1045.0830860457763\">17:25</span> 109. (Ka) nāmañca.</p><p>(Kha) rūpañca. ^1-0b-109</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1049.2607800286103\">17:29</span> 110. (Ka) avijjā ca.</p><p>(Kha) bhavataṇhā ca. ^1-0b-110</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1053.2267521716615\">17:33</span> 111. (Ka) bhavadiṭṭhi ca.</p><p>(Kha) vibhavadiṭṭhi ca. ^1-0b-111</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1057.763810087738\">17:37</span> 112. (Ka) sassatadiṭṭhi ca.</p><p>(Kha) ucchedadiṭṭhi ca. ^1-0b-112</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1063.410134196457\">17:43</span> 113. (Ka) antavā diṭṭhi ca.</p><p>(Kha) anantavā diṭṭhi ca. ^1-0b-113</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1067.9238281735688\">17:47</span> 114. (Ka) pubbantānudiṭṭhi ca.</p><p>(Kha) aparantānudiṭṭhi ca. ^1-0b-114</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1073.3862509485016\">17:53</span> 115. (Ka) ahirikañca.</p><p>(Kha) anottappañca. ^1-0b-115</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1078.2846199961853\">17:58</span> 116. (Ka) hirī ca.</p><p>(Kha) ottappañca. ^1-0b-116</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1082.0180898321532\">18:02</span> 117. (Ka) dovacassatā ca.</p><p>(Kha) pāpamittatā ca. ^1-0b-117</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1087.2678760019073\">18:07</span> 118. (Ka) sovacassatā ca.</p><p>(Kha) kalyāṇamittatā ca. ^1-0b-118</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1092.5867168760224\">18:12</span> 119. (Ka) āpattikusalatā ca.</p><p>(Kha) āpattivuṭṭhānakusalatā ca. ^1-0b-119</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1098.858870950409\">18:18</span> 120. (Ka) samāpattikusalatā ca.</p><p>(Kha) samāpattivuṭṭhānakusalatā ca. ^1-0b-120</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1106.1874770839233\">18:26</span> 121. (Ka) dhātukusalatā ca.</p><p>(Kha) manasikārakusalatā ca. ^1-0b-121</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1112.2117598989105\">18:32</span> 122. (Ka) āyatanakusalatā ca.</p><p>(Kha) paṭiccasamuppādakusalatā ca. ^1-0b-122</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1119.0341918264312\">18:39</span> 123. (Ka) ṭhānakusalatā ca.</p><p>(Kha) aṭṭhānakusalatā ca. ^1-0b-123</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1124.5626170419616\">18:44</span> 124. (Ka) ajjavo ca.</p><p>(Kha) maddavo ca. ^1-0b-124</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1128.8037568836517\">18:48</span> 125. (Ka) khanti ca.</p><p>(Kha) soraccañca. ^1-0b-125</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1132.3947819637604\">18:52</span> 126. (Ka) sākhalyañca.</p><p>(Kha) paṭisanthāro ca [paṭisandhāro ca (ka.)]. ^1-0b-126</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1137.505459929428\">18:57</span> 127. (Ka) indriyesu aguttadvāratā ca.</p><p>(Kha) bhojane amattaññutā ca. ^1-0b-127</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1145.1213890572205\">19:05</span> 128. (Ka) indriyesu guttadvāratā ca.</p><p>(Kha) bhojane mattaññutā ca. ^1-0b-128</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1152.5847478817443\">19:12</span> 129. (Ka) muṭṭhasaccañca.</p><p>(Kha) asampajaññañca. ^1-0b-129</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1157.6972710400544\">19:17</span> 130. (Ka) sati ca.</p><p>(Kha) sampajaññañca. ^1-0b-130</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1161.713881803543\">19:21</span> 131. (Ka) paṭisaṅkhānabalañca.</p><p>(Kha) bhāvanābalañca. ^1-0b-131</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1167.1234390076295\">19:27</span> 132. (Ka) samatho ca.</p><p>(Kha) vipassanā ca. ^1-0b-132</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1171.2658509790192\">19:31</span> 133. (Ka) samathanimittañca .</p><p>(Kha) paggāhanimittañca. ^1-0b-133</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1176.4654210610352\">19:36</span> 134. (Ka) paggāho ca.</p><p>(Kha) avikkhepo ca. ^1-0b-134</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1180.9933019656678\">19:40</span> 135. (Ka) sīlavipatti ca.</p><p>(Kha) diṭṭhivipatti ca. ^1-0b-135</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1186.1780327997285\">19:46</span> 136. (Ka) sīlasampadā ca.</p><p>(Kha) diṭṭhisampadā ca. ^1-0b-136</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1191.8732450572204\">19:51</span> 137. (Ka) sīlavisuddhi ca.</p><p>(Kha) diṭṭhivisuddhi ca. ^1-0b-137</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1197.0571441182556\">19:57</span> 138. (Ka) diṭṭhivisuddhi kho pana.</p><p>(Kha) yathādiṭṭhissa ca padhānaṃ. ^1-0b-138</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1203.90551690654\">20:03</span> 139. (Ka) saṃvego ca saṃvejaniyesu ṭhānesu.</p><p>(Kha) saṃviggassa ca yoniso padhānaṃ. ^1-0b-139</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1214.169413011444\">20:14</span> 140. (Ka) asantuṭṭhitā ca kusalesu dhammesu.</p><p>(Kha) appaṭivānitā ca padhānasmiṃ. ^1-0b-140</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1223.8664071010894\">20:23</span> 141. (Ka) vijjā ca.</p><p>(Kha) vimutti ca. ^1-0b-141</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1227.2644560133515\">20:27</span> 142. (Ka) khaye ñāṇaṃ.</p><p>(Kha) anuppāde ñāṇanti.</p><p>Suttantikadukamātikā [suttantamātikā (syā.)].</p><p>Mātikā niṭṭhitā. ^1-0b-142</p><p><br /></p><p> </p><p><br /></p><p></p>","media-time":8.837136}